cks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vfi"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"c99c6678-ffb7-44df-821e-e90ee0ca0dfd","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あとこれは朗報ですよ\n普段Go使ってる人からは絶対に出ない感想なので、Go使ってない人がebitenにたどり着くようになった\nこれはebitenの広がりを感じますね","ts":"1624757800.128900","thread_ts":"1624757800.128900","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IBSt"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"cfb90c82-2281-4010-9c77-eb68086f734b","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"MDNにゲーム開発の記事があった。知らなかった\n\u003chttps://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Games/Tutorials/2D_breakout_game_Phaser/Physics\u003e","ts":"1624760829.135300","attachments":[{"fallback":"物理演算 - ゲーム開発 | MDN","id":1,"title":"物理演算 - ゲーム開発 | MDN","title_link":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Games/Tutorials/2D_breakout_game_Phaser/Physics","text":"全 16回のゲーム開発チュートリアル の 5 回目です。 今回終了後のソースコードは Gamedev-Phaser-Content-Kit/demos/lesson05.html でご覧になれます。 モノ同士の衝突を正しく処理するためには、物理演算が必要になります。この文書では、Phaser での実装と、典型的な例を紹介します。","image_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/mdn-social-share.0ca9dbda.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"developer.mozilla.org","service_icon":"https://developer.mozilla.org/apple-touch-icon.0ea0fa02.png","from_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Games/Tutorials/2D_breakout_game_Phaser/Physics","original_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Games/Tutorials/2D_breakout_game_Phaser/Physics"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ","U06ECBRTJ"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zqUf0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"576c48df-a05c-46b4-8475-b18765fec618","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"とてもつよい","ts":"1624760564.134800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tal"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd71a184-9b2a-4694-9a24-16e975043d2c","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"逆にebiten知ってからretained modeなやつに触ると不自由でつらい","ts":"1624760395.134000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WFfKV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b763da23-f9b9-4e16-9d13-e55dc556e2cd","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"Retained-mode に慣れていると面食らうかもですね\n(でも) ebiten には DrawImageOptions があるので、シーングラフもサクッと書けそうです","ts":"1624760278.133400","edited":{"user":"U012MBD7MFZ","ts":"1624760597.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bQA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccf2dd32-9e26-4319-87b1-50e56e77b67b","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ていうかやっぱり今時はゲーム作るならエンジンに加えてエディタがあって当たり前なのかなあ\nどれだけ中身がボロボロでもデザイナーが触れた方がいいものが出来やすい　エンジニアは無力","ts":"1624759254.129800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LytAG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c99c6678-ffb7-44df-821e-e90ee0ca0dfd","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あとこれは朗報ですよ\n普段Go使ってる人からは絶対に出ない感想なので、Go使ってない人がebitenにたどり着くようになった\nこれはebitenの広がりを感じますね","ts":"1624757800.128900","thread_ts":"1624757800.128900","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IBSt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5d614b0-c5f0-4f73-874b-401f9cf2021a","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"他の分野ならまだオブジェクト指向のこと言ってるの？で終わるんですが、\nゲーム開発だとsimplicityのよさが伝わらないのはある程度しょうがないかな・・・と思ったり\nでもそこはebitenが頑張るところではないですね、なんかラップするものがあればいい","ts":"1624757721.127700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/vNUd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eca5a89d-5e71-4366-b982-88a0f5efcf82","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u003chttps://tqdev.com/2021-minesweeper-written-in-go-using-ebiten\u003e\n\u0026gt; Unlike what I expected, the Ebiten engine does not have the object oriented concepts like Sprite, Layer and Scene that I was familiar with from Pythonista, Flash, Flex and the like. Instead it provides just the method \"DrawImage\" that can draw onto the canvas. This makes it harder to organize your screens and graphics.\nSimplicity を重視したがゆえにこういう感想になってしまったか…","ts":"1624731781.125800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Minesweeper written in Go using Ebiten","id":1,"title":"Minesweeper written in Go using Ebiten","title_link":"https://tqdev.com/2021-minesweeper-written-in-go-using-ebiten","text":"It was already 7 years ago that I wrote Minesweeper for a the iPad on the iPad (using Pythonista). It was an implementation of Minesweeper in Python and it was optimized for touch usage. I have ported that implementation to Go using the Ebiten game engine...","blocks":null,"service_name":"tqdev.com","service_icon":"https://tqdev.com/img/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://tqdev.com/2021-minesweeper-written-in-go-using-ebiten","original_url":"https://tqdev.com/2021-minesweeper-written-in-go-using-ebiten"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P5d"}]}]
